# SCCF clinical review packets — this repo is PUBLIC.
# Packets quote live channel output and clinical correspondence; they are
# staged here, emailed to SCCF, and must never be committed.
docs/sccf-review/

# KB content (large, regenerated by ingestion scripts)
#
# `kb/en/*` rather than `kb/en/`: git does not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so a `!` exception under `kb/en/` would never be consulted.
# Excluding the directory's *contents* keeps the un-ignore below effective.
kb/en/*
# Exception: OncoTalks transcript drafts are SCCF-owned content that has to be
# reviewed in a pull request (see kb/README.md, issue #91). They are generated
# under the original caption language, so the English-original episodes land in
# kb/en/ — which the rule above would otherwise hide from `git status`, leaving
# the tracked staging manifest pointing at a file git never sees.
!kb/en/01_suchi_oncotalks/

# NCI Thesaurus OWL (57MB, too large for git)
*.owl

